{"data": {"Page": {"pageInfo": {"currentPage": 3, "hasNextPage": true}, "media": [{"id": 17339, "title": {"romaji": "Kentauros no Densetsu", "english": "The Legend of Kentauros"}, "format": "OVA", "description": "The Centaurs are a racing team of 93 bikers from the port city of Yokohama who are named after the legendary Greek horse/men. Arthur and Ken fall out over their love for the same lady deciding to settle their competition with a race.\n<br><br>\n(Source: The Anime Encyclopedia)", "startDate": {"year": 1987, "month": 12}, "endDate": {"year": 1987, "month": 12}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 1987, "episodes": 1, "duration": 95, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Drama"], "tags": [{"name": "Motorcycles", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Love Triangle", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "School", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Nudity", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 17689, "title": {"romaji": "Chironup no Kitsune", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Based on the novel \"Chironup no Kitsune (Foxes of Chironup)\" by Hiroyuki Takahashi.", "startDate": {"year": 1987, "month": 8}, "endDate": {"year": 1987, "month": 8}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 1987, "episodes": 1, "duration": 72, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "NOVEL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Drama"], "tags": [{"name": "Tragedy", "rank": 80, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Rural", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Animals", "rank": 75, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Historical", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Guns", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Ships", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Survival", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 18557, "title": {"romaji": "High School AGENT", "english": null}, "format": "OVA", "description": "Based on a manga by Tanimura Hitoshi, serialized in Comic Burger.<br><br>\nTeenager Kanemori Kousuke is a secret agent for the international VN spy network. Using his computer hacking skills, he tracks international criminals. Later he goes after Neo-Nazis to the Arctic were they try to raise a U-boat with a sinister secret.<br><br>\n(Source: The Anime Encyclopedia)", "startDate": {"year": 1987, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 1987, "month": 10}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 1987, "episodes": 2, "duration": 28, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Drama"], "tags": [{"name": "Military", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Snowscape", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Foreign", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Guns", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Espionage", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "School", "rank": 66, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Seinen", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 18795, "title": {"romaji": "DOUGRAM vs ROUND-FACER", "english": null}, "format": "SPECIAL", "description": "Flying Dougram battles in space.", "startDate": {"year": 1987, "month": 1}, "endDate": {"year": 1987, "month": 1}, "season": "WINTER", "seasonYear": 1987, "episodes": 1, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": null, "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Mecha", "Sci-Fi"], "tags": [{"name": "Space", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 19597, "title": {"romaji": "Milk House Dreaming: Ai no Shiki", "english": null}, "format": "OVA", "description": "An image video, setting watercolors from Yumiko Kawahara's 1983 manga to a series of 11 pop songs.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)", "startDate": {"year": 1987, "month": 11}, "endDate": {"year": 1987, "month": 11}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 1987, "episodes": 1, "duration": 43, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": null, "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Music"], "tags": [{"name": "Shoujo", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 19887, "title": {"romaji": "Shouri Toushu", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Based on Umeda Youko's novel.<br><br>\nNote: Although their opponents were fictional, team members of the Chunichi Dragons were based on the real-life team. Hoshiyama, depicted as the manager of the Dragons, was a real-life sports commentator at the time.", "startDate": {"year": 1987, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 1987, "month": 10}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 1987, "episodes": 1, "duration": 72, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "NOVEL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Sports"], "tags": [{"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Baseball", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 20077, "title": {"romaji": "Dotanba no Manners", "english": null}, "format": "TV_SHORT", "description": "An introduction to etiquette through the hapless antics of Mr. Dotanba, who manages to put his foot in it in innumerable social situations.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)", "startDate": {"year": 1984, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 1987, "month": 4}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 1984, "episodes": 283, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": null, "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy", "Slice of Life"], "tags": []}, {"id": 20083, "title": {"romaji": "Doteraman", "english": null}, "format": "TV", "description": "In a small town of Tokyo there lives a middle-aged man, Suzuki, who spends commonplace days conducting a small business. He is ambitious to become such a celebrity as to appear on the cover page of a popular magazine. <br><br>\nOne day he happens to discover a mysterious entrance that leads to an alien space. Through it he reaches the world of goblins and attaches control devices to goblins there to make them act at his free command. Capitalizing on those zombies, he grows outrageous and notoriously sets his hand to evil things. Meanwhile two witty pupils, Hajime and his girl friend Mariko, come across a strange alien detective who presents them with Doteraman garments. Wearing those garments, they transform themselves into Doteraman and Doterapink with supernatural strength. Then they challenge the wicked ruler and successfully liberate the poor goblins. They continue to fight in the cause of justice creating excitement and entertainment full of pleasure.<br><br>\n(Source: AniDB)", "startDate": {"year": 1986, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 1987, "month": 2}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 1986, "episodes": 20, "duration": 25, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy", "Sci-Fi"], "tags": [{"name": "Superhero", "rank": 65, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 101180, "title": {"romaji": "Little Nemo Pilot (1987)", "english": null}, "format": "SPECIAL", "description": "Alternative pilot made for Little Nemo: Adventures in Slumberland", "startDate": {"year": 1987, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 1987, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 10, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "OTHER", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Adventure"], "tags": []}, {"id": 102516, "title": {"romaji": "Direct Animation", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "A McLaren-inspired direct animation experimental short film by Taku Furukawa.", "startDate": {"year": 1987, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 1987, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 1, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 102518, "title": {"romaji": "Play Jazz", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Furukawa Taku film", "startDate": {"year": 1987, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 1987, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 103719, "title": {"romaji": "WALL", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "The further developed and completed version of a 15-second advertisement for an interior design firm on which I had worked. It repeats over and over again the violent back-and-forth, half-revolving motions of a giant brick storehouse inside the frame of a hand-held photograph. I wanted to emphasis the flat nature of the photograph while creating a dynamic feeling of depth inside the photograph’s frame.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Takashi Ito)", "startDate": {"year": 1987, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 1987, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 7, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 103954, "title": {"romaji": "Banana Mura ni Ame ga Furu", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Music video featured on NHK's Minna no Uta program", "startDate": {"year": 1987, "month": 8}, "endDate": {"year": 1987, "month": 8}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 103979, "title": {"romaji": "Shashinki '87", "english": "Photodiary 87"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "I turned my gaze to the various events in daily life and made this filmic diary in a manner as if confessing my feelings. Of course, since I was making the film, I wanted to depict these feelings and events with tricky techniques. I used various methods to shoot photographs of a relative’s wedding, the landscape I see from window of my house, commemorative travel photographs and the like frame-by-frame.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Takashi Ito)", "startDate": {"year": 1987, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 1987, "month": 7}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 3, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 104148, "title": {"romaji": "Mahou no Princess Minky Momo: Hitomi no Seiza - Minky Momo SONG Special", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "This music video features full versions of 9 songs from the series' OST.<br>\n<br>\nSong list from cover:<br>\n\"Love Love Minky Momo\"<br>\n\"Minky Stick Doriminpa\"<br>\n\"Good Looking Tonight\"<br>\n\"Itsuka Ojisamaga......\"<br>\n\"Love Is Window\"<br>\n\"Anatae no Love Song\"<br>\n\"Maho no Komoriuta\"<br>\n\"Swing Swing Chikyuni\"<br>\n\"Hitomi no Seiza\"<br>", "startDate": {"year": 1987, "month": 1}, "endDate": {"year": 1987, "month": 1}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 30, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "OTHER", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Mahou Shoujo", "Music"], "tags": [{"name": "Magic", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 105182, "title": {"romaji": "Mugen Senshi Valis", "english": null}, "format": "SPECIAL", "description": "On or around the release of the first game in the series on the Famicom, a 3-minute promotional anime was created to advertise the game. More than a commercial, less than a special, the piece tells a highly abbreviated version of the game's story (spoiling its biggest twist!).", "startDate": {"year": 1987, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 1987, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 3, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "VIDEO_GAME", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Adventure", "Fantasy"], "tags": [{"name": "School", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Advertisement", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Isekai", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Henshin", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Swordplay", "rank": 40, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Urban Fantasy", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Teen Cast", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Female Cast", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Tokusatsu", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 113656, "title": {"romaji": "Takarajima (Movie)", "english": "Treasure Island: The Movie"}, "format": "MOVIE", "descriptio